t;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;- TI (30) servidores, equipamentos de rede (99), impressoras, sensor e estações para administração e suporte remoto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;- Visitantes (40) somente Internet (80, 443, 53); IoT (50)&amp;nbsp;somente SRV-MON01 na porta 10051; impressoras só respondem ao SRV-ARQ01 e à TI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important; background-color: transparent !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;- Nada entra pela Internet; entre andares de usuários não há comunicação direta; a regra final bloqueia todo o tráfego não listado&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
